<title>FRANCE: Axa nine-month sales up 22.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Axa nine-month sales up 22.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     119,980    vs   97,799</p>
<p>    -- life insurance			   64,434    vs   46,510</p>
<p>    -- non-life insurance		     22,226    vs   21,712</p>
<p>    total insurance			     86,660    vs   68,222</p>
<p>    -- Europe				     42,376    vs   38,097</p>
<p>    -- North America			    31,114    vs   29,495</p>
<p>    -- Asia/Pacific			     13,169    vs	630</p>
<p>    Reinsurance				    7,158    vs    7,079</p>
<p>    Financial services and holdings	 26,162    vs   22,498</p>
<p>NOTE - AXA gave the figures in a statement.</p>
</text>
